Patch: 014-fake-sdk-system-prompt
Reason: the stand-in SDK sends a launch's system prompt by the real CLI's snapshot rule (a session's recorded prompt, made by its first launch with snapshot on; a launch with snapshot off sends its own and records nothing) and reports what each query sent, so a test can see what the model was told
Upstream: ours
Pins: the fake's snapshot rule is the real CLI's, case by case, as measured (Agent SDK 0.3.286)
---
